      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠶᠠᠩᠵᠣᠯᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>yangǰulaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>янзлах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>JANGZULA-</transcript>
      <definition>v.i. and t. To adorn, spruce up; to be pretty; to have a certain shape or manner; to put in order; to give oneself airs; to follow the fashion.</definition>
